<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Quick down 10% on gloomy outlook.</title>
<headline>Belgian Quick down 10% on gloomy outlook.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Belgian fast-food chain Quick opened ten percent lower at 2,290 francs and then fell further to 2,280 francs on Tuesday after the group said on Monday that first-half consolidated net profit plunged to seven million francs from 147 million in the first-half of 1995.</p>
<p>The group also said that it expected full-year 1996 profit to fall 30 to 35 percent.</p>
</text>
